Constructing KQL statements

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.230
for Microsoft Sentinel.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:31.440
This is where you'll learn
the core building blocks,

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.520
how to write queries that
